<title>CHILE: Chile's Celulosa Arauco 1996 net drops.</title>
<headline>Chile's Celulosa Arauco 1996 net drops.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chiile's largest wood pulp producer Celulosa Arauco y Constitucion reported the following results for last year.</p>
<p>			     1996		 1995</p>
<p>Net earnings	     40.84	     137.22</p>
<p>Operating income	 30.46	     142.71</p>
<p>Non-operating income   12.81		15.15</p>
<p>Total revenues	  179.43	     274.27</p>
<p>NOTE:1. All figures are in billions of Chilean pesos.</p>
<p>	 2. The company is a wholly owned subsidiary of Chilean</p>
<p>forestry firm Copec.</p>
<p>((--Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212))</p>
